      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "831．解方程：",
        "а) $6x^2-(2x-3)(3x+2)=2$；",
        "б) $(10x+9)x-(5x-1)(2x+3)=8$；",
        "в) $15-(x-5)(x-3)=0$；",
        "г) $12-(x+6)(x+2)=x(x-3)$；",
        "д) $x(x+1)(x+6)-x^3=5x$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "832",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "832．证明下列各式的值与变量的值无关：",
        "а) $(x-3)(x+7)-(x+5)(x-1)$；",
        "б) $y^4-(y^2-4)(y^2+4)$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "833",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "833．证明：",
        "а) 对于任意自然数 $n$，式子",
        "$n(n+5)-(n-3)(n+2)$",
        "的值，都能被 $6$ 整除；",
        "б) 对于大于 $2$ 的任意自然数，式子",
        "$(n-1)(n+1)-(n-7)(n-5)$",
        "的值，都能被 $12$ 整除．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "834",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "834．四个连续自然数中，已知两个大数的积与其余两个数的",
        "积之差等于 $58$．求这四个数．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "835",
